fe148f266e4004d417e021167bc06986.poster.avif?t=1754852546\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629230/extras/fe148f266e4004d417e021167bc06986.webm?t=1754852546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629230/extras/fe148f266e4004d417e021167bc06986.mp4?t=1754852546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
